text = "[color=#f1c27d][b]LE PETIT CHAPERON ROUGE[/b][/color]\nA story-driven survival prototype created as an app course project.\n\n[b]Engine[/b]  Godot 4.7\n[b]Format[/b]  Landscape mobile game\n[b]Theme[/b]  Memory, obedience, and the structures that define safety\n\n[color=#928b88]Music: Witch Fantasia\nThird-party assets remain credited with their source packages inside the project.[/color]"
